  |= Source file|= Role|
  | eap_server_did.c | request, challenge, fragmentation, CEK recovery, relay |
  | eap_did.c | request handling, presentation construction, fragmentation |
  | eap_did_vp.c | VP JWT construction (ES256K), credential loading |
  | eap_did_jwe.c | ECDH-1PU, Concat KDF, AES Key Wrap, A256CBC-HS512 |
  | eap_did_common.c | HKDF, Session-Id, did:peer parsing |
  | eap_did_http.c | HTTP transport, gzip, JSON field extraction |
endlegend

@enduml
